{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552020/extras/52c8381515866371b840a9d3e765965f.avif?t=1761586938\" width=800 height=155 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the only survivor of a fallen noble family, you are determined to uncover the mystery behind their demise. By an incredible stroke of luck, you are invited to interview for the role of Imperial Governess. It is your singular opportunity to work in the imperial palace, the very heart of the Empire\u2019s knowledge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet beneath the palace\u2019s glittering fa\u00e7ade, shadows lurk. Survive deadly schemes, uncover buried secrets, and make choices that branch into multiple, dramatically different endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you earn allies or make powerful enemies?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you unveil the truth that destroyed your family?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When love blossoms between you and the imperial princes, will it bring salvation or betrayal?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Love. Secrets. Power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you claim them all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your story awaits in Fate\u2019s Masquerade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552020/extras/04b1a8139656dde3e45a95ff8e5d66f3.avif?t=1761586938\" width=1000 height=194 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>LOVE INTERESTS</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Maximilian Windrake (The Crimson Reaper)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552020/extras/44a50150e60cebc9652ba7ffc0e54e75.poster.avif?t=1761586938\" width=720 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552020/extras/44a50150e60cebc9652ba7ffc0e54e75.webm?t=1761586938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552020/extras/44a50150e60cebc9652ba7ffc0e54e75.mp4?t=1761586938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Territory after territory fell beneath the shadow of this black-haired prince with eyes like bleeding rubies, expanding Ravensburg into the sprawling empire it is today. The war may be over, but he cannot lay down his armor. He\u2019s curt. He\u2019s rough. And he\u2019s a terrible conversationalist. Will you uncover the hidden depths of this fearsome prince, who seemingly only has duty on his mind?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lucian Windrake (The Enigmatic Enchanter)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552020/extras/df32c838786f901ea4e38166bc29bbd0.poster.avif?t=1761586938\" width=700 height=700 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552020/extras/df32c838786f901ea4e38166bc29bbd0.webm?t=1761586938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552020/extras/df32c838786f901ea4e38166bc29bbd0.mp4?t=1761586938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free from the weight of the crown, the second prince knows how to have more fun. Beloved by all, he\u2019s a ray of sunshine wherever he goes. Yet something about him feels\u2026 off. He seems to know everything, appears everywhere, and asks the most damning questions. Will you match his game or let yourself be played?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>SIDE CHARACTERS</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Victoria Rosemoore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552020/extras/12621fe7fa22bdf238d55b4ca099d15b.avif?t=1761586938\" width=500 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If perfection exists, then she is it. The only daughter of  Grand Duke Rosemoore, she is beautiful, rich, and betrothed to the crown prince. Most importantly, she's got the brains to make sure that no one gets in the way of getting what she wants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Nerissa Valeine</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552020/extras/fd8d4d0083e95347743db6a653630003.avif?t=1761586938\" width=500 height=500 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This mysterious companion of the mighty Emperor  is ignored and isolated by the Imperial Court. Her eyes hold a sadness and strength born from surviving the impossible, tempered by the courage to carve her own path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Amelia Windrake</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552020/extras/217b9cc531aa76b3c52323045d6575a3.avif?t=1761586938\" width=500 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This adorable little princess of the Empire is sweet, curious, and full of wonder. Without a mother figure, it falls to you to guide her and show her the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552020/extras/5e0355ad379dda475ba55663117f0314.avif?t=1761586938\" width=800 height=155 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2661\u00a0<strong>Customizable Heroine</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Name your heroine and make the choices that shape your destiny.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2661\u00a0<strong>Two Unique Routes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate two intertwined storylines, each with different challenges and dangers. Most importantly, lose yourself in two very different types of love. Only by journeying through both will you uncover the true mystery behind your own noble house.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2661 8+ Endings</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many paths lead to heartbreak, betrayal, or even death. Hopefully, your wisdom and bravery will lead you to love and peace.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2661 Spicy Scenes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your hard work will be rewarded with <i><strong>very</strong></i> steamy moments with the princes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2661 Animated Spirits &amp; CGs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch every scene come to life with moving characters with a wide range of expressions.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3552020?t=1761586938","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3552020?t=1761586938","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552020/c89e677b01c3814ae633428f5643902afa33c454/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761586938","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552020/c89e677b01c3814ae633428f5643902afa33c454/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761586938","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],