\" >This adorable little princess of the Empire is sweet, curious, and full of wonder. Without a mother figure, it falls to you to guide her and show her the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552020/extras/5e0355ad379dda475ba55663117f0314.avif?t=1761586938\" width=800 height=155 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2661\u00a0<strong>Customizable Heroine</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Name your heroine and make the choices that shape your destiny.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2661\u00a0<strong>Two Unique Routes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate two intertwined storylines, each with different challenges and dangers. Most importantly, lose yourself in two very different types of love. Only by journeying through both will you uncover the true mystery behind your own noble house.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2661 8+ Endings</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many paths lead to heartbreak, betrayal, or even death. Hopefully, your wisdom and bravery will lead you to love and peace.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2661 Spicy Scenes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your hard work will be rewarded with <i><strong>very</strong></i> steamy moments with the princes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2661 Animated Spirits &amp; CGs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch every scene come to life with moving characters with a wide range of expressions.</p>","developers":["Small Serenity Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552020/4e69e05e4bb301c947dcab446332b2788d9ec145/header.jpg?t=1761586938","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><